            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Elyo na ine namwipusha nati, “Nga ilya imiti ya miolifa ibili iyili ku cakutekapo ifisaniko uku noku, nayo yanshi? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.4.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.4.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 4:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nga ilya imisambo ibili iya muolifa ileitulwila amafuta mu mipaipi yabili aya golide, umo nayo amafuta yalekonkoloka, bushe nayo yanshi?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.4.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.4.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
